#. ja: 頭上に<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>「クエストアイコン」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>がついているキャラクターを選択すると、<br>クエストが開始されます。<br><br>リスフローを選択して、<br>クエストを始めましょう。
#. de: NPCs, die Aufträge anbieten, erkennt man an den <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ausrufezeichen</ui-edge-color></ui-color> über ihren Köpfen. Um das Auftragsfenster zu öffnen, sprich mit dem NPC, indem du ihn zunächst anvisierst und dann die Taste zum <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Bestätigen</ui-edge-color></ui-color> drückst.
#. fr: Les personnages proposant des quêtes sont facilement reconnaissables grâce à l'icone en forme de <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>point d'exclamation</ui-edge-color></ui-color> au-dessus de leur tête.<br><br>Pour lancer la quête, ciblez Ryssfloh et pressez ensuite la touche <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Confirmer</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.
#. column 5: Non-player characters (NPCs) offering quests can be recognized by the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>exclamation marks</ui-edge-color></ui-color> above their heads. To bring up the quest window, speak with the NPC by first targeting him, then pressing the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>confirm</ui-edge-color></ui-color> button.
#. column 6: Non-player characters (NPCs) offering quests can be recognized by the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>exclamation marks</ui-edge-color></ui-color> above their heads. To bring up the quest window, speak with the NPC by first targeting him, then pressing the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>confirm</ui-edge-color></ui-color> button.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
